cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata below, and
  cite the three underlying datasets listed under "references" directly if
  you reuse the data.
type: code
title: qtl-breast-cancer
abstract: >-
  Quantum Transfer Learning for Breast Cancer ultrasound classification.
  Builds cleaned, patterned manifests over three public breast-ultrasound
  datasets of increasing size (small, medium, big) to train and compare
  classical and quantum-transfer CNNs across dataset scale.
authors:
  - family-names: Santos
    given-names: Júlia
    email: juliasantos7652@gmail.com
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/jsvictorias/qtl-breast-cancer
references:
