    month: 2
    doi: 10.1016/j.dib.2019.104863
    url: https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2352340919312181
    notes: >-
      Used as the "small" dataset (data/raw/small). 780 images across
      benign, malignant, and normal classes, with lesion segmentation masks.
  - type: dataset
    title: >-
      BUS-BRA: A breast ultrasound dataset for assessing computer-aided
      diagnosis systems
    abbreviation: BUS-BRA
    authors:
