    end: 3123
    year: 2024
    doi: 10.1002/mp.16812
    url: https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37937827/
    notes: >-
      Used as the "medium" dataset (data/raw/medium). 1,875 images from
      1,064 patients, with BI-RADS categories, histology, and segmentation
      masks.
  - type: dataset
    title: "BUSIS: A benchmark for breast ultrasound image segmentation"
    abbreviation: BUSIS
