    start: 729
    year: 2022
    doi: 10.3390/healthcare10040729
    url: https://www.mdpi.com/2227-9032/10/4/729
    notes: >-
      Used as the "big" dataset (data/raw/big), specifically its
      GDPH&SYSUCC cohort (Guangdong Provincial People's Hospital and
      Sun Yat-sen University Cancer Center): 2,405 images, benign/malignant
